# LTI 2.54 frames captured from a Wallee A35 (2026-10), sanitized:
# ids, merchant data, card data and auth codes replaced by placeholders.
# '--- <<<' terminal -> till, '--- >>>' till -> terminal; body verbatim up to the next marker.
--- >>>
